path: /pricing
title: School management software price in Pakistan
description: Three plans by school size: {{PLAN_starter_name}} at {{PLAN_starter_monthly}} a month for up to {{PLAN_starter_limit}} pupils, {{PLAN_growth_name}} for up to {{PLAN_growth_limit}}, and {{PLAN_enterprise_name}} priced with you. Every module in every plan.
nav: Pricing
nav_order: 6
breadcrumb: Pricing
schema: org software
priority: 1.0
changefreq: weekly
---

<header class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Pricing</span>
    <h1>Priced for a real Pakistani school</h1>
    <p class="lede" style="max-width:64ch">
      Every plan includes every feature. You pay for the size of your school,
      not for modules. When you sign up you tell us how many pupils you have,
      and the plan follows from that. Pay for three months and save 10%; pay
      for a year and get two months free.
    </p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="prices">
      <div class="price" data-plan="starter">
        <h3 data-plan-name>{{PLAN_starter_name}}</h3>
        <div class="price__amt"><span data-price-monthly>{{PLAN_starter_monthly}}</span><small>/month</small></div>
        <p class="price__cap" data-price-cap>{{PLAN_starter_band}}</p>
        <table class="price__terms">
          <caption>Or pay ahead</caption>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">3 months <small>10% off</small></th>
            <td><b data-price-quarterly>{{PLAN_starter_quarterly}}</b> <small>You save <span data-save-quarterly>{{PLAN_starter_save3}}</span></small></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">A year <small>Two months free</small></th>
            <td><b data-price-yearly>{{PLAN_starter_yearly}}</b> <small>You save <span data-save-yearly>{{PLAN_starter_save12}}</span></small></td>
          </tr>
        </table>
        <ul>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>Every module included</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>Unlimited staff logins</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>Parent portal</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/contact" data-app="signup"
           aria-label="Start free trial. Signup asks how many pupils you have, and the plan follows from that">Start free trial</a>
      </div>

      <div class="price" data-plan="growth">
        <h3 data-plan-name>{{PLAN_growth_name}}</h3>
        <div class="price__amt"><span data-price-monthly>{{PLAN_growth_monthly}}</span><small>/month</small></div>
        <p class="price__cap" data-price-cap>{{PLAN_growth_band}}</p>
        <table class="price__terms">
          <caption>Or pay ahead</caption>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">3 months <small>10% off</small></th>
            <td><b data-price-quarterly>{{PLAN_growth_quarterly}}</b> <small>You save <span data-save-quarterly>{{PLAN_growth_save3}}</span></small></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">A year <small>Two months free</small></th>
            <td><b data-price-yearly>{{PLAN_growth_yearly}}</b> <small>You save <span data-save-yearly>{{PLAN_growth_save12}}</span></small></td>
          </tr>
        </table>
        <ul>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>Every module included</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>Unlimited staff logins</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>Parent portal</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/contact" data-app="signup"
           aria-label="Start free trial. Signup asks how many pupils you have, and the plan follows from that">Start free trial</a>
      </div>

      <div class="price" data-plan="enterprise">
        <h3 data-plan-name>{{PLAN_enterprise_name}}</h3>
        <div class="price__amt price__amt--words">Priced with you</div>
        <p class="price__cap" data-price-cap>{{PLAN_enterprise_band}}</p>
        <table class="price__terms">
          <caption>How we price it</caption>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">Monthly</th>
            <td><b>Agreed with you</b></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">3 months <small>10% off</small></th>
            <td><b>3 x your price, less 10%</b></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row">A year <small>Two months free</small></th>
            <td><b>10 x your price</b></td>
          </tr>
        </table>
        <ul>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>No pupil limit</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>Every module included</li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>The same 14 day trial</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="price__note">
          The three month and yearly prices follow from the monthly one unless we
          agree those with you too. At the end of the trial the software locks
          until your price is agreed, so talk to us before then.
        </p>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/contact" data-app="signup"
           aria-label="Start free trial. Signup asks how many pupils you have, and the plan follows from that">Start free trial</a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:28px;max-width:70ch">
      The number of pupils on your plan is a real limit. When the school reaches
      it, new admissions pause until you move up; the software warns you from
      90%, so it never arrives as a surprise. Ask from Settings and we move you
      to the next plan. Payment is by bank transfer: there is no card on file
      and nothing is taken from your account.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>What the price includes</h2>
    <div class="grid grid--3" style="margin-top:28px">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Every module</h3>
        <p>
          Fees, attendance, exams and result cards, accounts and payroll,
          certificates, ID cards, the parent portal and year end rollover. There
          is no premium tier holding one of them back.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>The trial, properly</h3>
        <p>
          Fourteen days, no card, and no crippled version. Put one real class in
          and run a month's challans against your own fee sheet. If the numbers
          do not agree with your register, do not buy it.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Your data, always</h3>
        <p>
          A full export in a plain readable format at any time, including on the
          day you leave. No lock in and no charge for your own records.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>How paying works</h2>
    <ul class="checklist" style="margin-top:22px">
      <li>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        <span><b>Bank transfer.</b> There is no card on file and nothing is taken from your account. An invoice carries our business name, NTN and bank account, so your accounts can file it and withhold what they must.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        <span><b>You pay for the time ahead.</b> Each invoice is due on the first day of the period it pays for. If it is not paid, everything keeps working for 14 more days, and then the software locks until it is.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        <span><b>The limit is the limit.</b> New admissions pause when you reach your plan's number of pupils. A warning shows from 90%, and when you ask from Settings we move you up.</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 10.5l4 4 8-9" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        <span><b>Stopping payment does not delete your records.</b> The account locks, the export keeps working, and nothing is destroyed on a date we chose.</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p style="margin-top:24px">
      <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/pricing" data-app="signup">Start the 14 day trial</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" href="/contact" style="margin-left:10px">Ask about a bigger school</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
